  durationSeconds: 90
  difficulty: "Hard"
  briefing: "Inspect the thermally bound fuel rod and deployment cask, select the insulated long-handled tool, gently rock and rotate the rod to release the binding, insert it into the RTG, and confirm that the science station is positioned at a safe distance from the lander. The task is the mechanical equipment procedure; any separate crew radiation screening is not a prerequisite."
